@startuml Sequence Diagram — Translation Flow

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #E8F5E9

title Translation Request Sequence (Chrome Extension → REST API → Gemini LLM)

actor User as U
participant "Chrome\nExtension\n(Side Panel)" as Ext #E8F5E9
participant "Jakarta REST\n(TranslatorResource)" as REST #FFF3E0
participant "Jakarta Security\n(Basic Auth)" as Auth #FCE4EC
participant "TranslationService" as Svc #E3F2FD
participant "GeminiApiClient\n(MicroProfile REST)" as GClient #F3E5F5
participant "Google Gemini\nLLM API" as Gemini #BBDEFB

== User Selects Text ==
U -> Ext: Right-clicks, selects\n"Translate to Darija"
Ext -> Ext: Opens Side Panel
Ext -> Ext: Auto-pastes selected text

== Translation Request ==
U -> Ext: Clicks "Translate"
Ext -> REST: POST /api/translate\nAuthorization: Basic <base64>\nContent-Type: application/json\n{ text, sourceLanguage }

== Authentication ==
REST -> Auth: Validate Basic credentials
Auth -> Auth: Lookup users.properties /\nroles.properties
alt Valid credentials
    Auth --> REST: Principal + Roles granted
else Invalid credentials
    Auth --> REST: 401 Unauthorized
    REST --> Ext: 401 Unauthorized
    Ext --> U: Show "Authentication failed"
end

== Business Logic ==
REST -> Svc: translate(TranslationRequest)
Svc -> Svc: buildPrompt(request)
note right of Svc
  Prompt Engineering:
  - Expert Darija translator persona
  - Few-shot examples
  - Temperature = 0.3 for consistency
  - Max 2048 output tokens
end note

== LLM API Call ==
Svc -> GClient: generateContent(model, apiKey, GeminiRequest)
GClient -> Gemini: POST /v1beta/models/gemini-1.5-flash:generateContent?key=...
Gemini -> Gemini: Inference / LLM processing
Gemini --> GClient: GeminiResponse { candidates[0].content.parts[0].text }
GClient --> Svc: GeminiResponse

== Response Assembly ==
Svc -> Svc: extractText() from response
Svc --> REST: TranslationResponse { status, translatedText, model, ... }
REST --> Ext: 200 OK\n{ originalText, translatedText, model, timestamp }

== Display Result ==
Ext -> Ext: Render Arabic RTL text
Ext --> U: Shows translation in Darija\n(e.g., "صباح الخير" → "صباح النور")
U -> Ext: Optional: Click 🔊 "Read Aloud"
Ext -> Ext: SpeechSynthesis.speak(translatedText, { lang: "ar-MA" })

@enduml
